    "description": "Changes label, description, unit, enum values, sensitivity, allowed provenance, freshness or status. `key` and `dataType` never change. Enum values can be added but never removed, because stored facts and rules use them; deactivate the attribute instead. Staff only. Reading needs attribute read access (ops lead, compliance, support); changes need attribute manage access (ops lead, super admin). Every change is audited, published as `attribute.changed` and clears the dictionary cache immediately.",
